  )
Author: Antton Alberdi [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Antton Alberdi <anttonalberdi@gmail.com>
Description: Validates declarative model specifications, fits joint species
    distribution models through interchangeable statistical engines, and
    exports engine-neutral result bundles for visualisation and projection.
